Sigzil Haight, the Shackled Prince, is a child of the [[Judge of Ages|Judge]] and a fiendish prince. His demesne is somewhere far out along the [[Infinite Horizon]].

His followers carry the smell of copper and brimstone. On the [[Geography/Star 221,325|Joker World at Star 221,325]], a Scale party found [[Geography/The Quorum|the Quorum]], a structure held by his servants and reached only by answering its door. Among them were a mage and an enforcer, and a horde of [[Hellion|Hellions]]; [[Flintlock Toboggan]] is chained in one of its rooms.

A second Scale party passed through the fountain of blood in the Quorum's hall into the prince's demesne beyond. There they found the [[Voice of Many]], a [[Hearts|Heart]] he had made and sealed for centuries, and freed it. Sigzil was away attending to his coronation and sent the [[Keeper of Chains]] in his place. The Voice of Many escaped with the delvers, and the Keeper was driven off.
